load ../decision-derivation.maude
--- An accepted decision folds on its witnessing incorporation edge.
search [1] in DECISION-DERIVATION : { dec(proposed, r0) inc(r0) support staleEdit anchorEdit contentEdit succ(proposed) supersedesEdge } =>* { ev(folded, r0) CFG:Cfg } .
--- It is implemented while the requirement it incorporates is supported.
search [1] in DECISION-DERIVATION : { dec(proposed, r0) inc(r0) support staleEdit anchorEdit contentEdit succ(proposed) supersedesEdge } =>* { ev(implemented, r0) CFG:Cfg } .
--- The support goes stale: the current view says so and the history stands.
search [1] in DECISION-DERIVATION : { dec(proposed, r0) inc(r0) support staleEdit anchorEdit contentEdit succ(proposed) supersedesEdge } =>* { ev(implemented, r0) CFG:Cfg } such that current(CFG:Cfg) == stale .
--- An accepted successor supersedes.
search [1] in DECISION-DERIVATION : { dec(proposed, r0) inc(r0) support staleEdit anchorEdit contentEdit succ(proposed) supersedesEdge } =>* { dec(superseded, r0) succ(accepted) CFG:Cfg } .
--- Without a witnessing edge nothing folds, and an anchor edit counted as folding does.
search in DECISION-DERIVATION : { dec(proposed, r0) support staleEdit anchorEdit contentEdit succ(proposed) supersedesEdge } =>* { ev(folded, R:Rev) CFG:Cfg } .
search [1] in DECISION-DERIVATION-WEAK-EDIT-FOLDS : { dec(proposed, r0) support staleEdit anchorEdit contentEdit succ(proposed) supersedesEdge } =>* { ev(folded, R:Rev) CFG:Cfg } .
--- A proposed successor never supersedes; the weakening lets it.
search in DECISION-DERIVATION : { dec(proposed, r0) inc(r0) support staleEdit anchorEdit contentEdit succ(proposed) supersedesEdge } =>* { dec(superseded, R:Rev) succ(proposed) CFG:Cfg } .
search [1] in DECISION-DERIVATION-WEAK-PROPOSED-SUCCESSOR : { dec(proposed, r0) inc(r0) support staleEdit anchorEdit contentEdit succ(proposed) supersedesEdge } =>* { dec(superseded, R:Rev) succ(proposed) CFG:Cfg } .
--- Staleness never erases the implementation event; the weakening erases it.
search in DECISION-DERIVATION : { dec(proposed, r0) inc(r0) support staleEdit anchorEdit contentEdit succ(proposed) supersedesEdge } =>* { dec(implemented, R:Rev) CFG:Cfg } such that hasEvent(implemented, R:Rev, CFG:Cfg) == false .
search [1] in DECISION-DERIVATION-WEAK-STALENESS-ERASES : { dec(proposed, r0) inc(r0) support staleEdit anchorEdit contentEdit succ(proposed) supersedesEdge } =>* { dec(implemented, R:Rev) CFG:Cfg } such that hasEvent(implemented, R:Rev, CFG:Cfg) == false .
--- Acceptance covers exact content: an edit leaves the new content unaccepted.
search in DECISION-DERIVATION : { dec(proposed, r0) inc(r0) support staleEdit anchorEdit contentEdit succ(proposed) supersedesEdge } =>* { dec(accepted, R:Rev) CFG:Cfg } such that isAttested(R:Rev, CFG:Cfg) == false .
search [1] in DECISION-DERIVATION-WEAK-EDIT-KEEPS-ACCEPTANCE : { dec(proposed, r0) inc(r0) support staleEdit anchorEdit contentEdit succ(proposed) supersedesEdge } =>* { dec(accepted, R:Rev) CFG:Cfg } such that isAttested(R:Rev, CFG:Cfg) == false .
quit
